.TH PMatrix 1 "June 2026"
.SH NAME
pmatrix \- Matrix rain with a built-in Pomodoro timer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pmatrix
[\-abBcfhlLnsmVxk] [\-u update] [\-C color] [\-t tty] [\-M message] [\-W mins] [\-R mins]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows a scrolling 'Matrix' like screen in the terminal, with a Pomodoro timer
wired into the animation. During a work phase the rain falls and a large
block-digit countdown is shown in the top-right corner. When the work phase
ends the rain freezes and a centered break countdown takes over the screen;
when the break ends the rain resumes and the next pomodoro begins. Pass
.I "\-W 0"
to disable the timer and get plain Matrix rain.
.PP
PMatrix is a fork of CMatrix by Chris Allegretta and Abishek V Ashok.
.SS OPTIONS
.TP
.I "\-W mins"
Pomodoro work duration in minutes (default 25). A value of 0 disables the
Pomodoro timer.
.TP
.I "\-R mins"
Pomodoro break (rest) duration in minutes (default 5).
.TP
.I "\-a"
Asynchronous scroll
.TP
.I "\-b"
Bold characters on
.TP
.I "\-B"
All bold characters (overrides \-b)
.TP
.I "\-f"
Force the linux $TERM type to be on
.TP
.I "\-l"
Linux mode (sets "matrix.fnt" font in console)
.TP
.I "\-o"
Use old-style scrolling
.TP
.I "\-c"
Use Japanese characters as seen in the original matrix. Requires appropriate fonts
.TP
.I "\-L"
Lock mode (can be closed from another terminal)
.TP
.I "\-h, \-?"
Print usage and exit
.TP
.I "\-r"
"Rainbow" mode, rainbow colored character
.TP
.I "\-k"
Characters change while scrolling
.TP
.I "\-n"
No bold characters (overrides \-b and \-B)
.TP
.I "\-s"
"Screensaver" mode, exits on first keystroke
.TP
.I "\-m"
"Lambda" mode, every character becomes a lambda
.TP
.I "\-x"
X window mode, use if your xterm is using mtx.pcf
.TP
.I "\-V"
Print version information and exit
.TP
.I "\-u delay"
Screen update delay 0 - 10, default 4
.TP
.I "\-C color"
Use this color for matrix (default green).
Valid colors are green, red, blue, white, yellow, cyan, magenta and black.
.TP
.I "\-M message"
Add a message in the center of pmatrix
.TP
.I "\-t tty"
Set tty to use
.SS KEYSTROKES
The following keystrokes are available during execution (unavailable in
\-s mode)
.TP
.I "space, p, P"
Pause/resume. During work this freezes the rain and the work clock; during a
break it freezes the break countdown.
.TP
.I "s, S"
Skip to the next Pomodoro phase (work -> break, or break -> next work)
.TP
.I "a"
Toggle asynchronous scroll
.TP
.I "b"
Random bold characters
.TP
.I "B"
All bold characters
.TP
.I "n"
Turn off bold characters
.TP
.I "0\-9"
Adjust update speed
.TP
.I "! @ # $ % ^ & )"
Change the color of the matrix to the corresponding color:
! \- red, @ \- green, # \- yellow, $ \- blue, % \- magenta, ^ \- cyan,
& \- white, ) \- black.
.TP
.I "q"
Quit the program
.SH BUGS
This program is very CPU intensive.  Don't be surprised if it eats up over
40% of your CPU at times.
.SH HOMEPAGE
https://github.com/immalleable/pmatrix
.SH SEE ALSO
Based on CMatrix: https://github.com/abishekvashok/cmatrix
